{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38590","headline":"和皮博士赴上京观中修灵斋赠威仪尊师兼见寄 · 吴融","name":"和皮博士赴上京观中修灵斋赠威仪尊师兼见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霓结双旌羽缀裙，七星坛上拜元君。\n精诚有爲天应感，章奏无私鬼怕闻。\n鹤驭已从烟际下，凤膏还向月中焚。\n白云乡路看看到，好驻流年翊圣文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38590.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38590","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}